1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,725
Hello, this is Michael Kruger from Kruger's Family Delicatessen.

2
00:00:04,285 --> 00:00:11,925
We've just received a delivery from your company, but on inspection we have found that an entire pallet of tinned anchovies has been damaged.

3
00:00:12,695 --> 00:00:15,345
It looks like they fell at some time during transportation.

4
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:18,865
Some of the tins have broken and are leaking oil.

5
00:00:19,605 --> 00:00:20,605
Many others are dented.

6
00:00:21,185 --> 00:00:23,865
We can't possibly accept them at the agreed price.

7
00:00:24,425 --> 00:00:27,525
We've already spent two hours cleaning up dripping oil.

8
00:00:27,865 --> 00:00:35,245
Either we can return them to you and you can deduct the costs from your next invoice, or we'll accept them at a substantial discount.

9
00:00:36,005 --> 00:00:37,485
Why don't you send a sales representative?

10
00:00:38,445 --> 00:00:40,425
We need to sort this out as soon as possible.

11
00:00:41,105 --> 00:00:41,245
Thanks.
